## Summary

I've successfully completed the research on AI coding tools updates from the last 7-14 days and generated the `whitelist-updates.json` file. Here's what I found:

### Products with Updates (5 out of 9):

1. **Claude Code** (June 12, 2026) - Major announcement: Suspension of Fable 5 and Mythos 5 models due to US export-control directive
2. **Devin** (June 12, 2026) - Session Folders feature and integration improvements
3. **Cursor** (June 10, 2026) - Bugbot performance improvements (3x faster, 22% cheaper) and SDK updates
4. **GitHub Copilot** (June 3, 2026) - VS May releases v1.120-v1.123 with Agents window and remote support
5. **Gemini CLI** (June 3, 2026) - Version v0.45.0 stable release with bug fixes

### Products with No Recent Updates:
- **Windsurf** - No updates found; noted that Devin Desktop is the new name for Windsurf
- **Aider** - Latest release was v0.86.2 in February 2026, outside the 14-day window
- **Continue** - No specific updates in June 2026; project was acquired by Cursor
- **Codex CLI** - Latest update was June 9, 2026 (v0.139.0), but insufficient details for a comprehensive entry

### Community Feedback Highlights:
- **Claude Fable 5/Mythos 5 suspension** generated significant discussion on HN, Reddit, Twitter/X, and Instagram about AI regulation
- **Cursor's Bugbot improvements** received positive feedback on LinkedIn and YouTube
- **Gemini CLI** faced criticism on Reddit and developer forums about UX and being "behind" competitors

The final JSON array is sorted by recency (June 12 → June 3) and includes community voices from Hacker News, Reddit, Twitter/X, LinkedIn, YouTube, Instagram, and official forums.

**Sources:**
- [Claude Release Notes](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/12138966-release-notes)
- [Cursor Changelog](https://cursor.com/changelog)
- [GitHub Copilot Changelog](https://github.blog/changelog/2026-06-03-github-copilot-in-visual-studio-code-may-releases/)
- [Devin Release Notes](https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview)
- [Gemini CLI Changelogs](https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/)
- [Snyk Blog on Fable/Mythos Suspension](https://snyk.io/blog/fable-mythos-suspension-security-takeaways/)

